acts->find()->select(['id'])->where(['expiration_date <' => $func->now('date')])->firstOrFail();\n}\n\n// the result of debug($func->now('date'));\nobject(Cake\\Database\\Expression\\FunctionExpression) {\n    [protected] _name => 'CURRENT_DATE'\n    [protected] _conjunction => ','\n    [protected] _conditions => []\n    [protected] _typeMap => object(Cake\\Database\\TypeMap) {\n        [protected] _defaults => []\n        [protected] _types => []\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThe generated SQL query:\n\n``` sql\nSELECT \n  Establishmentcontracts.id AS `Establishmentcontracts__id` \nFROM \n  establishmentcontracts Establishmentcontracts \nLIMIT \n  1\n```\n\nIf i use the Time class instead of the FunctionsBuilder\n\n``` php\n$this->Establishmentcontracts->find()->select(['id'])->where(['expiration_date <' => \\Cake\\I18n\\Time::today()])->firstOrFail();\n```\n\nthe condition will be added, that's the geneated SQL query:\n\n``` sql\nSELECT \n  Establishmentcontracts.id AS `Establishmentcontracts__id` \nFROM \n  establishmentcontracts Establishmentcontracts \nWHERE \n  expiration_date < '2016-01-01' \nLIMIT \n  1\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"Use